{"id":84,"name":"الإنشقاق","transliteration":"Al-Inshiqaq","translation_fr":"La déchirure","translation_en":"The Sundering","type":"meccan","total_verses":25,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"إِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ ٱنشَقَّتۡ","translation_fr":"Quand le ciel se déchirera","translation_en":"When the sky has split [open]","transliteration":"Itha alssamao inshaqqat"},{"id":2,"text":"وَأَذِنَتۡ لِرَبِّهَا وَحُقَّتۡ","translation_fr":"et obéira à son Seigneur - et fera ce qu'il doit faire","translation_en":"And has responded to its Lord and was obligated [to do so]","transliteration":"Waathinat lirabbiha wahuqqat"},{"id":3,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡأَرۡضُ مُدَّتۡ","translation_fr":"et que la terre sera nivelée","translation_en":"And when the earth has been extended","transliteration":"Waitha alardu muddat"},{"id":4,"text":"وَأَلۡقَتۡ مَا فِيهَا وَتَخَلَّتۡ","translation_fr":"et qu'elle rejettera ce qui est en son sein (les morts) et se videra","translation_en":"And has cast out that within it and relinquished [it]","transliteration":"Waalqat ma feeha watakhallat"},{"id":5,"text":"وَأَذِنَتۡ لِرَبِّهَا وَحُقَّتۡ","translation_fr":"et qu'elle obéira à son Seigneur - et fera ce qu'elle doit faire","translation_en":"And has responded to its Lord and was obligated [to do so]","transliteration":"Waathinat lirabbiha wahuqqat"},{"id":6,"text":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ إِنَّكَ كَادِحٌ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ كَدۡحٗا فَمُلَٰقِيهِ","translation_fr":"O homme! Toi qui t'efforces vers ton Seigneur sans relâche, tu Le rencontreras alors","translation_en":"O mankind, indeed you are laboring toward your Lord with [great] exertion and will meet it","transliteration":"Ya ayyuha alinsanu innaka kadihun ila rabbika kadhan famulaqeehi"},{"id":7,"text":"فَأَمَّا مَنۡ أُوتِيَ كِتَٰبَهُۥ بِيَمِينِهِۦ","translation_fr":"Celui qui recevra son livre en sa main droite","translation_en":"Then as for he who is given his record in his right hand","transliteration":"Faama man ootiya kitabahu biyameenihi"},{"id":8,"text":"فَسَوۡفَ يُحَاسَبُ حِسَابٗا يَسِيرٗا","translation_fr":"sera soumis à un jugement facile","translation_en":"He will be judged with an easy account","transliteration":"Fasawfa yuhasabu hisaban yaseeran"},{"id":9,"text":"وَيَنقَلِبُ إِلَىٰٓ أَهۡلِهِۦ مَسۡرُورٗا","translation_fr":"et retournera réjoui auprès de sa famille","translation_en":"And return to his people in happiness","transliteration":"Wayanqalibu ila ahlihi masrooran"},{"id":10,"text":"وَأَمَّا مَنۡ أُوتِيَ كِتَٰبَهُۥ وَرَآءَ ظَهۡرِهِۦ","translation_fr":"Quant à celui qui recevra son livre derrière son dos","translation_en":"But as for he who is given his record behind his back","transliteration":"Waamma man ootiya kitabahu waraa thahrihi"},{"id":11,"text":"فَسَوۡفَ يَدۡعُواْ ثُبُورٗا","translation_fr":"il invoquera la destruction sur lui-même","translation_en":"He will cry out for destruction","transliteration":"Fasawfa yadAAoo thubooran"},{"id":12,"text":"وَيَصۡلَىٰ سَعِيرًا","translation_fr":"et il brûlera dans un feu ardent","translation_en":"And [enter to] burn in a Blaze","transliteration":"Wayasla saAAeeran"},{"id":13,"text":"إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ فِيٓ أَهۡلِهِۦ مَسۡرُورًا","translation_fr":"Car il était tout joyeux parmi les siens","translation_en":"Indeed, he had [once] been among his people in happiness","transliteration":"Innahu kana fee ahlihi masrooran"},{"id":14,"text":"إِنَّهُۥ ظَنَّ أَن لَّن يَحُورَ","translation_fr":"et il pensait que jamais il ne ressusciterait","translation_en":"Indeed, he had thought he would never return [to Allah]","transliteration":"Innahu thanna an lan yahoora"},{"id":15,"text":"بَلَىٰٓۚ إِنَّ رَبَّهُۥ كَانَ بِهِۦ بَصِيرٗا","translation_fr":"Mais si! Certes, son Seigneur l'observait parfaitement","translation_en":"But yes! Indeed, his Lord was ever of him, Seeing","transliteration":"Bala inna rabbahu kana bihi baseeran"},{"id":16,"text":"فَلَآ أُقۡسِمُ بِٱلشَّفَقِ","translation_fr":"Non!... Je jure par le crépuscule","translation_en":"So I swear by the twilight glow","transliteration":"Fala oqsimu bialshshafaqi"},{"id":17,"text":"وَٱلَّيۡلِ وَمَا وَسَقَ","translation_fr":"et par la nuit et ce qu'elle enveloppe","translation_en":"And [by] the night and what it envelops","transliteration":"Waallayli wama wasaqa"},{"id":18,"text":"وَٱلۡقَمَرِ إِذَا ٱتَّسَقَ","translation_fr":"et par la lune quand elle devient pleine lune","translation_en":"And [by] the moon when it becomes full","transliteration":"Waalqamari itha ittasaqa"},{"id":19,"text":"لَتَرۡكَبُنَّ طَبَقًا عَن طَبَقٖ","translation_fr":"Vous passerez, certes, par des états successifs","translation_en":"[That] you will surely experience state after state","transliteration":"Latarkabunna tabaqan AAan tabaqin"},{"id":20,"text":"فَمَا لَهُمۡ لَا يُؤۡمِنُونَ","translation_fr":"Qu'ont-ils à ne pas croire","translation_en":"So what is [the matter] with them [that] they do not believe","transliteration":"Fama lahum la yuminoona"},{"id":21,"text":"وَإِذَا قُرِئَ عَلَيۡهِمُ ٱلۡقُرۡءَانُ لَا يَسۡجُدُونَۤ۩","translation_fr":"et à ne pas se prosterner quand le Coran leur est lu","translation_en":"And when the Qur'an is recited to them, they do not prostrate [to Allah]","transliteration":"Waitha quria AAalayhimu alquranu la yasjudoona"},{"id":22,"text":"بَلِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ يُكَذِّبُونَ","translation_fr":"Mais ceux qui ne croient pas, le traitent plutôt de mensonge","translation_en":"But those who have disbelieved deny","transliteration":"Bali allatheena kafaroo yukaththiboona"},{"id":23,"text":"وَٱللَّهُ أَعۡلَمُ بِمَا يُوعُونَ","translation_fr":"Or, Allah sait bien ce qu'ils dissimulent","translation_en":"And Allah is most knowing of what they keep within themselves","transliteration":"WaAllahu aAAlamu bima yooAAoona"},{"id":24,"text":"فَبَشِّرۡهُم بِعَذَابٍ أَلِيمٍ","translation_fr":"Annonce-leur donc un châtiment douloureux","translation_en":"So give them tidings of a painful punishment","transliteration":"Fabashshirhum biAAathabin aleemin"},{"id":25,"text":"إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَعَمِلُواْ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ لَهُمۡ أَجۡرٌ غَيۡرُ مَمۡنُونِۭ","translation_fr":"Sauf ceux qui croient et accomplissent les bonnes œuvres: à eux une récompense jamais interrompue","translation_en":"Except for those who believe and do righteous deeds. For them is a reward uninterrupted","transliteration":"Illa allatheena amanoo waAAamiloo alssalihati lahum ajrun ghayru mamnoonin"}]}